WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.970 --> 00:02.240
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

4
00:02.260 --> 00:03.510
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

5
00:03.530 --> 00:04.780
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

6
00:04.800 --> 00:06.050
viewer discretion is advised]

7
00:06.120 --> 00:07.450
Te sammukha.

8
00:07.470 --> 00:09.250
May the spawns of asuras perish

9
00:09.420 --> 00:10.920
by the hands of my sacred masters.

10
00:12.510 --> 00:14.210
These nine enchanted rounds

11
00:14.440 --> 00:15.690
took much to craft,

12
00:16.010 --> 00:17.130
as you may have witnessed.

13
00:18.340 --> 00:20.230
Mind how you spend them.

14
00:20.980 --> 00:22.500
I am not the only soul

15
00:22.810 --> 00:24.600
to assist you.

16
00:24.810 --> 00:26.800
He deem me his mother,

17
00:27.200 --> 00:29.310
and himself my son.

18
00:30.710 --> 00:31.880
Thong.

19
00:33.100 --> 00:34.310
Where is your mommy?

20
01:10.010 --> 01:11.010
You smell good.

21
01:32.490 --> 01:34.210
I'm good at doing laundry.

22
01:44.070 --> 01:45.700
I shall lend you a hand

23
01:46.100 --> 01:47.700
so that it may be finished with haste...

24
01:53.400 --> 01:54.510
for I may

25
01:54.530 --> 01:57.000
linger with you all the longer this morn

26
01:57.610 --> 01:59.290
before you betake yourself to work.

27
02:03.760 --> 02:05.510
You can be sweet

28
02:05.840 --> 02:07.600
and affectionate, I see.

29
02:09.610 --> 02:11.700
I kinda want you

30
02:12.010 --> 02:14.090
to have periods more often

31
02:14.900 --> 02:17.480
if you're gonna be this cute and affectionate.

32
02:18.610 --> 02:19.890
You do go on.

33
02:23.000 --> 02:24.390
I'm kidding.

34
02:25.000 --> 02:27.680
Who'd want you to be in pain?

35
02:30.700 --> 02:33.450
There are many sides of me yet to be discovered, my dearest.

36
02:34.310 --> 02:36.510
Should you linger with me until that very day,

37
02:37.620 --> 02:39.410
you shall behold

38
02:39.990 --> 02:41.200
all of me.

39
02:47.700 --> 02:48.700
Let's see.

40
02:48.910 --> 02:50.320
Do you really want me to discover it?

41
02:50.510 --> 02:51.600
Can I see?

42
02:56.510 --> 02:57.810
I told you afore

43
02:58.460 --> 02:59.600
that I shall never halt you.

44
03:01.480 --> 03:02.480
Hm...

45
03:02.610 --> 03:04.190
Do you mean it?

46
03:04.390 --> 03:05.200
Let's see.

47
03:05.280 --> 03:06.930
Let me prove that

48
03:06.950 --> 03:08.510
you really won't stop me.

49
03:16.900 --> 03:19.020
I'll stay here with you

50
03:19.690 --> 03:20.790
for a long, long time.

51
03:24.510 --> 03:26.000
You promised?

52
03:28.150 --> 03:29.900
Since we've already

53
03:29.920 --> 03:32.900
made a mess on the bedsheets...

54
03:33.110 --> 03:34.520
should we...

55
03:37.310 --> 03:39.310
pick up where we left off?

56
03:40.410 --> 03:42.500
Never once have I halted you, my dearest.

57
03:43.420 --> 03:44.590
Really?

58
04:15.600 --> 04:16.750
As I said afore,

59
04:16.770 --> 04:18.200
I shall do the laundry myself.

60
04:20.820 --> 04:22.000
It's okay.

61
04:22.210 --> 04:23.820
I'm happy to do it for you.

62
04:23.840 --> 04:24.720
Hey,

63
04:24.750 --> 04:26.590
I may not look it,

64
04:26.610 --> 04:29.040
but I'm really good at doing laundry.

65
04:29.060 --> 04:30.020
Look at this.

66
04:31.000 --> 04:32.000
Here,

67
04:32.410 --> 04:33.680
the stains

68
04:33.710 --> 04:34.810
are nowhere to be found.

69
04:44.970 --> 04:45.900
I thank you

70
04:45.920 --> 04:47.010
for not being aghast.

71
04:48.920 --> 04:49.650
Of course.

72
04:54.610 --> 04:56.410
What is that lovely smell?

73
05:02.530 --> 05:03.700
Is it from here?

74
05:03.720 --> 05:05.010
Let's see...mmm.

75
05:07.310 --> 05:08.310
Ow!

76
05:09.910 --> 05:10.700
Blushing?

77
05:12.430 --> 05:13.900
It is infused with flowers.

78
05:14.500 --> 05:16.890
I mingle flowers already offered to the sacred masters

79
05:16.910 --> 05:18.330
with scented water,

80
05:18.350 --> 05:20.720
dry them, and use them to scent my garments.

81
05:21.610 --> 05:22.820
No wonder

82
05:22.840 --> 05:26.490
every time I get close to you,

83
05:27.260 --> 05:28.360
I can smell...

84
05:29.090 --> 05:30.510
something so heavenly.

85
05:31.420 --> 05:32.330
Turns out,

86
05:32.820 --> 05:33.610
it's...

87
05:34.110 --> 05:35.680
the smell of flowers.

88
05:37.990 --> 05:38.690
Come on,

89
05:38.710 --> 05:40.310
let me put it to the test.

90
05:42.740 --> 05:43.620
Ow!

91
05:44.300 --> 05:45.100
My beloved!

92
05:46.120 --> 05:47.520
Do you find it pleasing?

93
05:48.700 --> 05:49.850
If so,

94
05:49.870 --> 05:53.010
I shall turn them into a potpourri for you to cherish.

95
05:53.420 --> 05:55.310
Whenever the scent greets you,

96
05:56.100 --> 05:58.810
you shall dream of me by your side without end.

97
06:00.110 --> 06:01.110
Thanks.

98
06:01.620 --> 06:02.300
Well...

99
06:02.900 --> 06:04.090
that sounds good.

100
06:04.120 --> 06:07.530
When I go out and about,

101
06:07.550 --> 06:08.780
it's gonna feel like...

102
06:09.300 --> 06:11.660
you're with me at all times.

103
06:16.000 --> 06:17.040
Is this it?

104
06:22.710 --> 06:23.710
Smells good.

105
06:26.610 --> 06:27.720
It smells exactly like you.

106
06:28.200 --> 06:28.920
But...

107
06:29.790 --> 06:30.590
this...

108
06:30.900 --> 06:31.840
smells better.

109
06:44.620 --> 06:45.620
Ow...

110
07:37.900 --> 07:39.190
Who are you?

111
07:41.120 --> 07:42.770
Do you not remember me?

112
07:42.790 --> 07:44.010
Bulan.

113
07:57.890 --> 07:59.100
Is everything alright?

114
08:02.950 --> 08:03.990
It is, indeed.

115
08:04.400 --> 08:05.560
Go inside, my dearest.

116
08:08.440 --> 08:09.660
Jeez,

117
08:09.680 --> 08:11.920
it took me an hour to hang them out to dry.

118
08:11.940 --> 08:14.400
It's too damn windy, my beloved.

119
08:15.000 --> 08:17.600
There goes your dearest's masterpiece.

120
08:19.300 --> 08:20.090
My dearest,

121
08:20.120 --> 08:21.120
let us go inside.

122
08:22.220 --> 08:22.970
Sure.

123
08:25.810 --> 08:27.000
Let's go, my beloved.

124
08:57.680 --> 09:02.080
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

125
09:02.100 --> 09:06.750
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

126
09:06.770 --> 09:11.080
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

127
09:11.100 --> 09:15.400
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

128
09:15.420 --> 09:19.830
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

129
09:19.850 --> 09:24.350
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

130
09:24.370 --> 09:28.460
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

131
09:28.480 --> 09:33.030
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

132
09:33.050 --> 09:38.160
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

133
10:12.320 --> 10:13.610
I'm Lom,

134
10:14.300 --> 10:16.000
Master's chief disciple.

135
10:22.990 --> 10:24.340
How fortunate that

136
10:24.360 --> 10:27.020
the ceremony is being held on a day when the sanctum is closed.

137
10:27.510 --> 10:29.510
This way, I wouldn't have to babysit the sanctum

138
10:29.530 --> 10:31.490
when you and Ms. Ladfah

139
10:31.510 --> 10:32.730
go make merit together.

140
10:34.810 --> 10:36.540
And where is Ladfah?

141
10:36.560 --> 10:38.410
Why has she allowed you here all alone, dear Lom?

142
10:39.210 --> 10:41.190
Ugh, my mom?

143
10:41.210 --> 10:42.420
It hurts just talking about it.

144
10:42.730 --> 10:44.840
Mom told me she'd meet me at your sanctum,

145
10:44.860 --> 10:46.740
but she ended up bailing.

146
10:47.110 --> 10:47.940
Here,

147
10:47.960 --> 10:49.990
she asked me to make merit on her behalf.

148
10:51.100 --> 10:53.200
At what point can one make merit on behalf of another?

149
10:54.570 --> 10:55.370
It can be done.

150
10:56.520 --> 10:58.550
She already wired the money!

151
10:58.570 --> 11:00.820
Look, I've bought so many things for merit-making.

152
11:00.840 --> 11:02.320
There's more

153
11:02.340 --> 11:03.540
in the car.

154
11:03.560 --> 11:04.330
Boom!

155
11:04.910 --> 11:07.480
I'm planning to make tons of merit,

156
11:07.640 --> 11:09.000
so maybe I'll be blessed enough

157
11:09.020 --> 11:10.810
to finally be taken.

158
11:11.310 --> 11:12.080
I'm so fed up with

159
11:12.100 --> 11:13.540
being single,

160
11:13.560 --> 11:14.490
lonely,

161
11:14.510 --> 11:15.610
and forlorn.

162
11:18.490 --> 11:20.720
How many times have I told you afore

163
11:20.740 --> 11:22.550
that you shall find your mate

164
11:22.570 --> 11:24.290
when the time is ripe?

165
11:24.550 --> 11:26.050
Before then,

166
11:26.070 --> 11:28.600
your paths shall always miss, never to cross.

167
11:28.770 --> 11:30.210
Alright,

168
11:30.640 --> 11:31.890
I know.

169
11:32.540 --> 11:33.300
But...

170
11:33.320 --> 11:34.480
people's lives

171
11:34.500 --> 11:36.080
are driven by love.

172
11:37.300 --> 11:38.430
Without it,

173
11:39.800 --> 11:41.720
you have no strength to eat,

174
11:41.740 --> 11:43.110
walk,

175
11:43.620 --> 11:44.620
or sleep.

176
11:45.500 --> 11:48.230
There's no strength to do anything!

177
11:48.610 --> 11:49.610
By the way...

178
11:50.320 --> 11:53.580
you look so healthy,

179
11:53.870 --> 11:54.980
with...

180
11:55.800 --> 11:56.800
glowing skin.

181
11:58.220 --> 12:00.900
Anything that's been keeping you satisfied?

182
12:02.690 --> 12:04.000
Your mouth

183
12:04.200 --> 12:05.920
is, indeed, as big as ever.

184
12:06.990 --> 12:08.130
Whoa...

185
12:08.150 --> 12:10.210
I was just teasing you.

186
12:10.700 --> 12:11.750
You're just...

187
12:11.770 --> 12:13.100
so brutal.

188
12:16.520 --> 12:17.520
By the way,

189
12:18.310 --> 12:19.720
who is she?

190
12:20.050 --> 12:20.970
Where is she from?

191
12:30.250 --> 12:31.800
I'm asking you, Master.

192
12:32.570 --> 12:33.510
Where...

193
12:34.610 --> 12:35.970
are you from?

194
12:40.500 --> 12:41.810
I'm...

195
12:42.380 --> 12:44.880
in a little bit of trouble,

196
12:44.990 --> 12:45.990
so...

197
12:46.770 --> 12:49.710
I'm staying with Master for the time being.

198
12:52.600 --> 12:55.190
I too am Master's disciple.

199
12:55.780 --> 12:57.570
Typically...

200
12:58.010 --> 13:01.590
Master wouldn't just let any disciple stay at her sanctum.

201
13:03.100 --> 13:03.960
I don't think that's the case.

202
13:04.660 --> 13:06.400
Disparate deeds, disparate occasions.

203
13:06.710 --> 13:08.530
I deem it appropriate that she stays,

204
13:08.550 --> 13:09.680
so I let her.

205
13:10.950 --> 13:13.040
Then, could I please spend the night here?

206
13:14.400 --> 13:16.080
I miss Thong,

207
13:16.530 --> 13:18.020
and I wanna gossip

208
13:18.040 --> 13:18.920
in case...

209
13:19.090 --> 13:22.040
I've...missed something somewhere.

210
13:22.670 --> 13:23.790
Could I, dear Master?

211
13:24.220 --> 13:25.500
How could you not?

212
13:25.850 --> 13:27.730
You too are my disciple, dear Lom.

213
13:29.010 --> 13:29.790
Do spend the night here.

214
13:30.100 --> 13:32.000
Do not waste your money on a hotel room.

215
13:32.020 --> 13:34.000
I shall ready you a chamber.

216
13:40.810 --> 13:41.880
Then...

217
13:42.490 --> 13:44.990
I'd better get going to work.

218
13:45.010 --> 13:46.130
I'm already running late.

219
13:50.220 --> 13:50.980
Heading out.

220
13:57.200 --> 13:58.200
Dear Lom.

221
13:58.530 --> 13:59.090
Yes?

222
13:59.110 --> 14:01.170
Mind your limits when you trifle.

223
14:01.190 --> 14:02.510
Keep chaos at bay,

224
14:02.890 --> 14:05.130
or they might say you do not know any better.

225
14:05.300 --> 14:06.190
Oops...

226
14:06.910 --> 14:09.110
I was just being playful.

227
14:09.620 --> 14:11.330
You're being way too harsh.

228
14:12.910 --> 14:13.910
I just...

229
14:14.870 --> 14:16.100
wanna know

230
14:17.020 --> 14:18.590
what your karmic soulmate

231
14:19.290 --> 14:20.210
is like.

232
14:23.740 --> 14:24.590
Well...

233
14:25.260 --> 14:27.000
how do you see her?

234
14:29.100 --> 14:30.640
Are we of one mind?

235
14:31.850 --> 14:32.900
Mm...

236
14:33.800 --> 14:34.790
So...

237
14:36.530 --> 14:37.720
Does she know

238
14:39.500 --> 14:42.020
what awaits her

239
14:43.480 --> 14:45.120
as your karmic soulmate?

240
14:50.100 --> 14:52.010
I traveled into town to make a few purchases

241
14:52.030 --> 14:53.760
for almsgiving at the grand ceremony;

242
14:53.780 --> 14:55.400
thus, I am paying you a visit, Venerable Mother.

243
14:55.670 --> 14:57.020
Is there anything you desire?

244
14:57.040 --> 14:58.710
I shall make a purchase for you.

245
15:00.160 --> 15:01.720
I am well.

246
15:01.740 --> 15:03.410
I am in need of nothing.

247
15:07.130 --> 15:09.610
Dear Lom is still as lively as ever.

248
15:09.760 --> 15:11.080
Let's see.

249
15:12.780 --> 15:14.290
You're such a cutie!

250
15:15.040 --> 15:16.410
She has bloomed into womanhood

251
15:16.840 --> 15:18.210
but still behaves like a child.

252
15:19.940 --> 15:21.700
You too, my beautiful daughter.

253
15:22.270 --> 15:23.790
There is still

254
15:23.810 --> 15:25.000
a childlike glimmer in your eyes,

255
15:26.170 --> 15:27.820
and your radiant face

256
15:28.150 --> 15:29.720
makes you look younger than thirty.

257
15:30.720 --> 15:32.220
I suppose

258
15:32.670 --> 15:34.810
you are in love, my beautiful daughter.

259
15:37.550 --> 15:39.410
I wonder if you are content,

260
15:40.100 --> 15:42.110
both your beautiful self

261
15:42.580 --> 15:44.680
and the karmic soulmate whom you have just found.

262
15:47.910 --> 15:50.400
It is indeed what you and Father have taught me.

263
15:51.610 --> 15:52.700
In sorrow,

264
15:53.000 --> 15:54.410
it is agony.

265
15:54.930 --> 15:56.000
In happiness,

266
15:56.270 --> 15:57.700
it is euphoria.

267
15:59.020 --> 16:01.810
Life is not nearly as simple as it once was,

268
16:02.590 --> 16:04.320
but I yearn not for the past.

269
16:05.790 --> 16:08.020
Were there to be any hurdles along the way,

270
16:08.620 --> 16:10.800
I wish to triumph over them with her.

271
16:13.210 --> 16:14.910
Had your father been alive,

272
16:15.790 --> 16:18.210
he would have slapped his knee with delight.

273
16:27.100 --> 16:28.400
So what is the reason...

274
16:28.710 --> 16:31.400
for that sorrowful look on your visage, my beautiful daughter?

275
16:32.260 --> 16:33.880
Should something be on your mind,

276
16:33.900 --> 16:35.310
pray tell,

277
16:35.910 --> 16:37.600
so that your burden may be eased.

278
16:41.370 --> 16:44.320
Have you heard a word of him?

279
16:46.540 --> 16:49.190
Ever since he left the late master's sanctum,

280
16:50.100 --> 16:51.300
barely

281
16:51.830 --> 16:53.740
a whisper about him has reached my ears.

282
16:55.380 --> 16:57.110
I bore him,

283
16:57.710 --> 16:59.500
but his frame is his own,

284
16:59.910 --> 17:01.620
and so is his mind.

285
17:02.310 --> 17:04.310
I could not halt him.

286
17:05.810 --> 17:08.070
My beautiful daughter, you inquired of him.

287
17:08.100 --> 17:10.310
Do you have anything on your mind?

288
17:13.320 --> 17:15.390
I dreamed of him, Mother.

289
17:15.720 --> 17:17.200
I am worried

290
17:17.820 --> 17:19.600
that he might do evil.

291
17:21.820 --> 17:22.820
Mother...

292
17:23.090 --> 17:24.590
About the sorcerous tiger,

293
17:24.900 --> 17:27.340
know you my heart well enough to believe

294
17:27.360 --> 17:29.150
that I never mused to usurp it?

295
17:32.280 --> 17:33.710
The sorcerous tiger

296
17:34.770 --> 17:37.610
is not to be bequeathed to any soul.

297
17:38.660 --> 17:40.890
The late master must have bequeathed it to you

298
17:40.910 --> 17:43.200
for a sensible reason.

299
17:44.250 --> 17:45.890
It is your duty

300
17:46.410 --> 17:48.310
to hallow it.

301
17:50.470 --> 17:51.490
My beautiful daughter,

302
17:51.730 --> 17:53.700
worry not.

303
17:58.110 --> 18:00.110
Beyond all else,

304
18:00.520 --> 18:02.010
whatever shall happen

305
18:02.600 --> 18:03.800
shall happen.

306
18:06.100 --> 18:07.600
I trust that

307
18:08.130 --> 18:09.900
your virtues

308
18:10.500 --> 18:12.130
will shield her

309
18:12.150 --> 18:14.290
from any harm.

310
18:21.420 --> 18:23.220
Even when I ought to commit heinous karma,

311
18:24.320 --> 18:26.200
I shall protect her.

312
18:29.160 --> 18:31.650
[Phop Phra Police Station]

313
18:31.670 --> 18:33.510
Do you know why I called you in?

314
18:35.290 --> 18:37.600
It's about Sergeant Piak and me

315
18:37.920 --> 18:40.140
trespassing on private property

316
18:40.160 --> 18:42.270
to capture a suspect, sir.

317
18:43.480 --> 18:44.480
And what else?

318
18:46.850 --> 18:49.020
About Sergeant Piak and me

319
18:49.310 --> 18:50.420
operating across districts

320
18:50.440 --> 18:52.520
without permission, sir.

321
18:53.100 --> 18:54.590
So you realize all that.

322
18:55.400 --> 18:56.730
And why did you still proceed?

323
18:58.840 --> 19:00.410
Or is someone backing you up?

324
19:01.770 --> 19:03.700
Sarge, since you've been here a long time,

325
19:03.980 --> 19:06.120
I trusted you with taking care of Lieutenant Peem.

326
19:06.140 --> 19:07.300
And what is this?

327
19:08.260 --> 19:09.600
What kind of senior are you?

328
19:10.520 --> 19:11.890
Why didn't you stop her?

329
19:12.710 --> 19:14.380
I am sorry, Chief.

330
19:14.710 --> 19:16.250
I'll take disciplinary action against you, Sarge.

331
19:16.690 --> 19:18.820
It is not his fault, sir.

332
19:19.300 --> 19:22.240
He was just following my orders.

333
19:22.700 --> 19:24.440
If you're taking disciplinary action,

334
19:25.000 --> 19:26.780
you should take it against me,

335
19:26.800 --> 19:27.990
not him.

336
19:28.290 --> 19:29.800
Do you want to be a hero?

337
19:30.300 --> 19:32.510
Don't think I won't punish you

338
19:32.910 --> 19:33.780
out of respect for your parents.

339
19:33.800 --> 19:36.220
I'm not here to be anyone's hero.

340
19:37.100 --> 19:38.510
I'm here

341
19:38.920 --> 19:41.490
to fulfill my duty as a police officer,

342
19:41.510 --> 19:43.150
which is to pursue and capture criminals,

343
19:43.170 --> 19:44.560
even outside our jurisdiction.

344
19:46.020 --> 19:48.450
And if my intention to capture a criminal

345
19:48.470 --> 19:50.710
means disobeying your orders, Chief,

346
19:51.120 --> 19:52.890
I'll accept whatever punishment you give me.

347
19:54.340 --> 19:55.880
Keep up that cockiness.

348
19:59.900 --> 20:00.810
Please don't!

349
20:02.670 --> 20:03.800
I'm begging you!

350
20:04.430 --> 20:05.900
Can we talk this out calmly?

351
20:06.450 --> 20:07.490
Do whatever you want.

352
20:07.510 --> 20:08.440
You can even punish me

353
20:08.610 --> 20:09.710
or cut my salary.

354
20:09.890 --> 20:11.090
I'll accept whatever comes my way!

355
20:16.750 --> 20:17.510
If you're so capable,

356
20:18.300 --> 20:19.710
close this case.

357
20:21.880 --> 20:23.040
What are you saying, sir?

358
20:23.890 --> 20:26.620
I'm saying I'm officially assigning you two

359
20:26.640 --> 20:28.810
to work on this case.

360
20:31.300 --> 20:33.410
Go, deploy to the area fast

361
20:34.460 --> 20:36.730
and monitor the Krua Tan Procession.

362
20:37.110 --> 20:38.110
Understood, sir!

363
20:38.820 --> 20:39.610
Yes, sir.

364
20:56.000 --> 20:56.800
Sarge,

365
20:58.130 --> 20:59.480
what are they doing?

366
21:00.190 --> 21:01.000
Oh.

367
21:01.600 --> 21:02.600
Those are baskets called "Guay."

368
21:03.900 --> 21:05.390
It's Da day, a preparation day.

369
21:05.500 --> 21:07.210
It's the day before the merit-making event,

370
21:07.520 --> 21:09.700
so the villagers are weaving Guay baskets

371
21:09.720 --> 21:11.050
to put the offerings in.

372
21:11.720 --> 21:12.460
It's just...

373
21:12.990 --> 21:15.520
Simply put, they're like woven bamboo baskets for offerings to monks.

374
21:16.100 --> 21:17.100
Mm...

375
21:17.390 --> 21:19.400
Yeah, and tomorrow is the Krua Tan Procession.

376
21:19.750 --> 21:20.800
There's a lottery called "Salak Bhat,"

377
21:20.820 --> 21:21.750
where a monk calls you

378
21:21.770 --> 21:24.490
to make an offering if your lot is drawn.

379
21:26.300 --> 21:28.920
So it's like a New Year's lucky draw, Sarge?

380
21:29.490 --> 21:30.570
Something like that.

381
21:31.700 --> 21:34.500
It's merit-making without targeting a specific monk,

382
21:34.810 --> 21:36.380
so you gain immense merit in return.

383
21:37.100 --> 21:37.810
Lieutenant,

384
21:38.110 --> 21:39.010
are you interested?

385
21:40.710 --> 21:41.980
Let's not, Sarge.

386
21:42.000 --> 21:43.100
I don't think

387
21:43.120 --> 21:44.600
it's appropriate to play around

388
21:44.620 --> 21:46.160
while we're on patrol.

389
21:46.500 --> 21:47.500
Please do it, Lieutenant.

390
21:47.890 --> 21:49.910
We just encountered something evil the other day.

391
21:51.210 --> 21:51.840
Let's go.

392
21:53.600 --> 21:54.300
Come on.

393
21:54.700 --> 21:55.570
Is it a good idea, Sarge?

394
21:55.960 --> 21:56.710
Of course.

395
21:56.730 --> 21:58.290
How is making merit not a good idea?

396
22:00.020 --> 22:01.300
But I've never done this, Sarge.

397
22:01.320 --> 22:02.320
Neither have I.

398
22:13.000 --> 22:14.360
Legend has it that

399
22:14.930 --> 22:17.420
if a daughter of a household pounds chilli paste loudly,

400
22:18.160 --> 22:20.560
she is ready for marriage.

401
22:20.830 --> 22:21.500
Ugh!

402
22:22.210 --> 22:24.180
I couldn't be more ready.

403
22:24.750 --> 22:26.770
When will I get to marry, Master?

404
22:28.300 --> 22:30.010
I told you afore not to be in haste.

405
22:31.400 --> 22:33.000
Soon enough, you shall find them.

406
22:33.400 --> 22:34.610
Wow...

407
22:34.630 --> 22:36.390
If you already know this much,

408
22:36.800 --> 22:38.120
just spill already.

409
22:38.900 --> 22:39.710
Ugh.

410
22:39.900 --> 22:41.500
Next year, I'll turn 25,

411
22:41.530 --> 22:42.800
the ominous age.

412
22:43.400 --> 22:46.110
I'll probably have bad luck every other day.

413
22:46.130 --> 22:47.020
Dear Lom,

414
22:47.320 --> 22:49.620
the bird-of-paradise yantra I inked on you,

415
22:49.790 --> 22:52.590
apart from turning every word you utter into wealth and fortune,

416
22:52.710 --> 22:55.920
shall also make your words come true, as though you were a prophet.

417
22:56.910 --> 22:58.600
Thus, should you speak of goodness,

418
22:58.810 --> 23:00.590
good things shall come to you,

419
23:01.160 --> 23:02.400
but should you speak thoughtlessly,

420
23:02.600 --> 23:05.110
bad things shall also come your way.

421
23:17.590 --> 23:18.380
Hey...

422
23:18.740 --> 23:20.190
are you two cooking?

423
23:20.900 --> 23:24.000
We are preparing supper for the almshouse tomorrow.

424
23:24.550 --> 23:26.130
What have you brought in your hands, my dearest?

425
23:28.400 --> 23:29.400
Little Guay baskets.

426
23:29.880 --> 23:32.040
I wove them myself

427
23:32.060 --> 23:33.410
so we can go make merit

428
23:34.090 --> 23:35.640
at the temple tomorrow.

429
23:43.370 --> 23:45.030
Well, well.

430
23:45.490 --> 23:47.240
Are you two making merit by yourselves?

431
23:48.290 --> 23:50.280
I'm here, too.

432
23:51.000 --> 23:53.320
I don't see a Guay basket you wove for me.

433
23:54.120 --> 23:55.120
How inconsiderate.

434
23:55.240 --> 23:56.280
Dear Lom.

435
23:56.740 --> 23:57.550
Oops...

436
23:57.890 --> 23:58.890
I was just...

437
23:59.610 --> 24:01.020
joking.

438
24:02.210 --> 24:03.710
Whoever you intended to give it to...

439
24:04.570 --> 24:06.050
let it be so, Officer.

440
24:07.920 --> 24:09.490
Fine work for your first endeavor.

441
24:09.710 --> 24:12.020
I shall treasure tomorrow's alms

442
24:12.040 --> 24:14.040
in this little Guay basket you made.

443
24:16.860 --> 24:18.030
It's beautiful, isn't it?

444
24:22.690 --> 24:23.890
And...

445
24:24.210 --> 24:25.720
is there anything I can help you with?

446
24:58.110 --> 24:58.900
Here.

447
25:00.830 --> 25:01.620
Did you...

448
25:02.590 --> 25:03.800
weave it for me?

449
25:05.470 --> 25:07.500
Wow!

450
25:12.410 --> 25:15.050
I'm not that inconsiderate.

451
25:15.670 --> 25:16.490
Just take it.

452
25:16.960 --> 25:18.170
Now, you have...

453
25:18.310 --> 25:21.110
something to carry your stuff when we go make merit tomorrow.

454
25:24.000 --> 25:26.320
You're a good person at heart.

455
25:27.310 --> 25:28.800
No wonder

456
25:29.230 --> 25:31.600
you're Master's karmic soulmate.

457
25:34.820 --> 25:35.670
Look,

458
25:35.690 --> 25:37.390
I worked so hard on it.

459
25:38.520 --> 25:39.520
Isn't it neat?

460
25:42.030 --> 25:43.210
A red birthmark!

461
25:46.300 --> 25:48.500
If you place your hand next to Master's,

462
25:48.520 --> 25:50.090
they'll form...

463
25:50.230 --> 25:51.680
a perfect heart?

464
25:53.700 --> 25:54.480
Mm.

465
25:54.850 --> 25:56.300
Whoa...

466
26:10.040 --> 26:10.720
Lom,

467
26:12.190 --> 26:14.380
can I ask you something?

468
26:14.720 --> 26:15.160
Mm.

469
26:15.810 --> 26:18.500
The term "karmic soulmate,"

470
26:19.700 --> 26:21.060
what does it mean?

471
26:26.200 --> 26:27.820
"Karmic soulmates"

472
26:29.990 --> 26:33.100
are two souls bound by the merits of past lives

473
26:35.010 --> 26:37.400
and destined to meet each other,

474
26:38.210 --> 26:39.300
love each other,

475
26:40.020 --> 26:40.800
and...

476
26:41.500 --> 26:43.710
enhance each other's virtues.

477
26:45.700 --> 26:46.620
Look,

478
26:46.640 --> 26:48.140
your existence

479
26:48.260 --> 26:52.600
makes Master a woman of boundless might and virtue.

480
26:55.880 --> 26:56.920
But...

481
26:56.940 --> 26:58.510
on the other hand,

482
27:00.200 --> 27:02.600
Master's weakness

483
27:02.650 --> 27:04.620
has started to take shape.

484
27:07.780 --> 27:09.210
But don't you worry.

485
27:10.450 --> 27:12.220
Master will protect you.

486
27:13.400 --> 27:15.760
She's not gonna let any harm come to you.

487
27:16.100 --> 27:18.310
I'm not worried about myself.

488
27:18.330 --> 27:20.320
I'm worried about her.

489
27:20.610 --> 27:23.010
I also wanna shield her...

490
27:23.290 --> 27:25.480
from any harm.

491
27:25.980 --> 27:26.560
So...

492
27:27.740 --> 27:29.480
what are you waiting for?!

493
27:29.840 --> 27:32.010
Why haven't you asked my master to be your girlfriend?

494
27:39.360 --> 27:40.360
Well...

495
27:40.800 --> 27:41.800
I...

496
27:42.130 --> 27:43.620
don't know how to explain this,

497
27:43.640 --> 27:45.840
but our relationship...

498
27:46.120 --> 27:48.070
is rather complicated.

499
27:48.100 --> 27:49.550
Besides,

500
27:49.570 --> 27:51.320
I don't even know if...

501
27:51.540 --> 27:53.680
this Master of yours

502
27:53.790 --> 27:56.120
feels the same way I do.

503
28:00.940 --> 28:02.900
Before all this,

504
28:03.710 --> 28:05.210
a wealthy person

505
28:05.500 --> 28:07.180
brought cash

506
28:07.610 --> 28:09.280
and land title deeds

507
28:09.900 --> 28:11.510
to ask for her hand in marriage.

508
28:12.310 --> 28:13.790
But she

509
28:14.320 --> 28:15.590
reject it all,

510
28:16.930 --> 28:18.250
saying,

511
28:18.270 --> 28:20.810
"I shall only linger for my karmic soulmate,"

512
28:22.220 --> 28:24.060
which is you!

513
28:24.650 --> 28:27.880
If you want to define your relationship,

514
28:28.880 --> 28:30.690
you have to do something.

515
28:34.300 --> 28:35.300
Go ahead.

516
28:41.900 --> 28:43.120
How do you mean, dear Lom?

517
28:43.890 --> 28:46.290
I've been in an ambiguous relationship.

518
28:47.390 --> 28:49.590
Without a clear label,

519
28:50.900 --> 28:53.550
the other person could get confused, Master.

520
28:58.620 --> 29:00.440
And do my actions

521
29:00.470 --> 29:02.600
not speak plainly enough, then?

522
29:06.410 --> 29:08.850
Are actions alone cutting it these days?

523
29:09.290 --> 29:11.450
Words also matter.

524
29:12.190 --> 29:14.530
If you don't wanna lose the lieutenant,

525
29:15.980 --> 29:19.620
you have to give her some clarity, Master.

526
29:28.620 --> 29:29.620
Then...

527
29:30.160 --> 29:31.160
off I go.

528
29:44.120 --> 29:45.120
Want to sit?

529
30:00.900 --> 30:01.680
Hey.

530
30:05.710 --> 30:06.990
You're still awake, right?

531
30:23.220 --> 30:23.920
Hey...

532
30:32.000 --> 30:33.200
It's just that...

533
30:34.900 --> 30:36.390
I...

534
30:38.070 --> 30:39.310
I mean...

535
30:40.900 --> 30:42.120
I...

536
30:42.800 --> 30:44.610
I wanna say that...

537
30:46.740 --> 30:47.410
That...

538
30:47.800 --> 30:50.180
- I... - Do say what you wish to.

539
30:51.900 --> 30:53.180
I'm just gonna say...

540
30:56.400 --> 30:58.200
Good night.

541
30:59.180 --> 30:59.890
Sweet dreams

542
31:00.960 --> 31:02.410
tonight.

543
31:26.900 --> 31:27.590
Thong,

544
31:28.300 --> 31:29.600
your mom is not killing it.

545
31:31.350 --> 31:32.880
A full 100 points deducted.

546
31:59.350 --> 32:00.400
What say you

547
32:00.720 --> 32:02.420
of the attire I sewed for you?

548
32:02.440 --> 32:03.500
Is it not a thing of beauty?

549
32:06.800 --> 32:07.800
It is...

550
32:10.270 --> 32:11.210
No,

551
32:11.230 --> 32:12.230
I should say...

552
32:13.000 --> 32:15.110
How ethereal, Master.

553
32:23.060 --> 32:24.600
You meant...

554
32:26.400 --> 32:28.210
the attire I sewed for you, did you not?

555
32:33.720 --> 32:34.720
Come,

556
32:35.100 --> 32:36.610
I shall dress you in perfume.

557
33:14.600 --> 33:16.320
It's morning. Let's go to the temple!

558
33:20.100 --> 33:20.740
Ooh...

559
33:22.850 --> 33:25.880
Whoa... Wow!

560
33:26.730 --> 33:28.240
What a beauty.

561
33:31.520 --> 33:32.680
Then...

562
33:32.700 --> 33:33.880
I will...

563
33:34.820 --> 33:36.200
wait for you guys downstairs.

564
33:45.410 --> 33:46.520
Master.

565
33:46.910 --> 33:49.380
I bought so many desserts.

566
33:49.400 --> 33:51.810
Let's go enjoy them downstairs.

567
33:56.500 --> 33:57.600
Off I go now.

568
34:11.370 --> 34:12.580
Thank you.

569
35:14.670 --> 35:16.870
Can I write my little brother's name

570
35:16.890 --> 35:18.690
on the paper as well?

571
35:21.080 --> 35:23.750
[Pichapat Ruechakun]

572
35:24.210 --> 35:25.210
Certainly,

573
35:26.050 --> 35:28.590
though you have to specify

574
35:28.610 --> 35:29.890
that the merits shall be dedicated

575
35:29.910 --> 35:31.870
to the recovery of the wounded,

576
35:32.180 --> 35:34.120
for if you merely write down the name,

577
35:34.220 --> 35:36.190
the monks will chant a prayer for the deceased,

578
35:36.510 --> 35:37.760
which is bad luck.

579
35:38.430 --> 35:39.810
Ah...

580
35:40.290 --> 35:41.620
I just learned something new.

581
35:41.640 --> 35:42.730
So,

582
35:42.750 --> 35:44.480
what am I supposed to write down?

583
35:54.440 --> 35:56.520
[Pichapat Ruechakun, and alms on behalf of]

584
36:03.840 --> 36:06.510
Then, you may write your brother's name

585
36:07.100 --> 36:08.680
after this word.

586
36:13.140 --> 36:14.140
Right here?

587
36:20.240 --> 36:24.130
[Phuvaphatch Ruechakun]

588
36:27.710 --> 36:28.600
All done.

589
36:33.400 --> 36:34.820
Let us go inside.

590
36:38.610 --> 36:40.850
- Dear Lom, follow along. - Alright.

591
36:42.120 --> 36:43.310
Hello, Mom?

592
36:44.230 --> 36:46.710
Pray tell, the name you would have me write down,

593
36:46.730 --> 36:47.670
Ms. Ladfah.

594
36:47.690 --> 36:49.690
Your name, Miss Tinee.

595
36:49.710 --> 36:52.930
A little bird told me that your life's been sucking lately, no?

596
36:53.860 --> 36:55.410
Who's that little bird?

597
36:55.440 --> 36:56.650
Which one of my friends?

598
36:56.670 --> 36:58.210
I will be sure to deal with them.

599
36:58.230 --> 37:00.060
Don't mess with my informants.

600
37:00.080 --> 37:01.700
Miss Tinee, I am serious.

601
37:01.720 --> 37:03.000
Alright, alright.

602
37:03.560 --> 37:06.110
[Ms. Natinee Tangjareon]

603
37:07.880 --> 37:09.200
Ooh, it's okay.

604
37:13.670 --> 37:14.620
Where is it?

605
37:15.710 --> 37:16.960
Thank you.

606
37:23.000 --> 37:24.000
Thank you.

607
37:29.900 --> 37:30.900
Alright, Mom.

608
37:31.300 --> 37:33.010
I'm gonna hurry and make merit now.

609
37:35.900 --> 37:36.900
Thank you.

610
37:38.200 --> 37:39.310
My folks

611
37:39.330 --> 37:42.210
and all devoted laypeople,

612
37:43.290 --> 37:45.450
the venerable masters and the monastic assembly,

613
37:46.010 --> 37:47.780
and all novice monks

614
37:47.950 --> 37:49.630
from every temple in the district

615
37:49.660 --> 37:51.730
have now taken their seats at the Salak Bhat tables

616
37:51.750 --> 37:54.030
around the ordination hall.

617
37:54.050 --> 37:55.510
Next up,

618
37:55.540 --> 37:57.110
my folks,

619
37:57.300 --> 37:59.150
please check your ticket numbers.

620
37:59.900 --> 38:00.780
The venerable sirs

621
38:00.800 --> 38:03.230
will have the novice monks

622
38:03.250 --> 38:05.660
call out the names to find the owners of the strips of paper.

623
38:05.680 --> 38:08.230
If you hear your name,

624
38:08.240 --> 38:10.500
or the name of the relative you wish to dedicate it to,

625
38:10.520 --> 38:13.180
please bring the alms in your Guay basket

626
38:13.200 --> 38:15.700
to the venerable sirs.

627
38:18.410 --> 38:20.080
Dear Lom, are you departing for home already?

628
38:20.700 --> 38:23.131
I have to drive to Chiang Rai

629
38:23.156 --> 38:24.960
to return the car to Ms. Ladfah before flying to Bangkok.

630
38:25.140 --> 38:27.530
Pray, keep well, dear Lom.

631
38:28.480 --> 38:29.830
Dwell in the present.

632
38:29.850 --> 38:31.810
Think not too much of the future.

633
38:32.810 --> 38:34.270
As for your mate,

634
38:34.290 --> 38:35.590
make no haste to find one.

635
38:36.110 --> 38:37.900
Your soulmate was already born.

636
38:38.630 --> 38:41.080
Soon enough, you shall meet them without endeavor.

637
38:43.490 --> 38:47.080
Like how you met yours, right?

638
38:49.690 --> 38:50.300
Ow!

639
38:51.060 --> 38:53.130
Dwell not on my affairs.

640
38:58.580 --> 39:00.500
Next year, you shall reach an age ending in 5,

641
39:01.680 --> 39:02.490
which is not good.

642
39:03.210 --> 39:05.110
Should any peril arise,

643
39:05.130 --> 39:06.520
make haste to pay me a visit.

644
39:06.540 --> 39:07.380
Do you understand?

645
39:08.860 --> 39:10.130
Sure thing.

646
39:10.150 --> 39:11.320
If anything happens,

647
39:11.340 --> 39:13.170
I'll come see you as soon as possible.

648
39:14.060 --> 39:15.710
But it'd be better

649
39:16.250 --> 39:17.880
if we met at a merit-making ceremony

650
39:17.910 --> 39:18.910
or...

651
39:19.710 --> 39:21.950
a grand, auspicious ceremony.

652
39:29.610 --> 39:32.080
Well then, I'll be going.

653
39:33.190 --> 39:34.730
Have a safe journey.

654
39:35.960 --> 39:36.680
Goodbye.

655
39:57.500 --> 39:59.090
Let Master sniff your head once

656
40:00.200 --> 40:01.320
for good fortune.

657
40:02.810 --> 40:04.820
All done, Ms. Ladfah.

658
40:04.840 --> 40:06.530
I am on my way to you.

659
40:07.910 --> 40:10.800
I'm so hungry! Emphasis on "so."

660
40:11.200 --> 40:14.890
I wanna eat Ms. Ladfah's chicken khao soi.

661
40:15.620 --> 40:17.090
Don't try to sweet-talk me. [Ms. Ladfah (Mom)]

662
40:17.520 --> 40:19.390
You only come home once in a while,

663
40:19.400 --> 40:20.620
so whatever you want to eat,

664
40:20.640 --> 40:22.030
I got you, Miss Tinee.

665
40:28.010 --> 40:28.820
Argh!

666
40:29.710 --> 40:31.750
Lom, what happened?!

667
40:34.210 --> 40:34.990
I...

668
40:36.080 --> 40:37.880
I... I think I....

669
40:38.020 --> 40:39.900
I think I ran over something.

670
40:40.210 --> 40:41.530
I'm hanging up.

671
40:54.600 --> 40:55.380
A cat!

672
40:57.020 --> 40:57.770
Help!

673
40:57.790 --> 40:58.880
Please help the cat!

674
40:58.910 --> 41:00.500
- Ma'am... - Hand it over.

675
41:02.150 --> 41:02.930
You can let go.

676
41:17.020 --> 41:18.270
Doctor,

677
41:18.290 --> 41:19.450
how's the cat?

678
41:19.640 --> 41:21.810
Right now, the cat has lost a lot of blood,

679
41:21.820 --> 41:24.000
but our clinic doesn't have any blood on hand.

680
41:24.020 --> 41:25.820
I'll make some calls and see if I can find some.

681
41:27.610 --> 41:28.610
Doctor...

682
41:31.200 --> 41:31.920
Mom...

683
41:33.040 --> 41:34.600
I didn't mean to.

684
41:36.010 --> 41:39.290
I accidentally ran over a kitten in the temple.

685
41:41.020 --> 41:43.200
Calm down, Lom. Get a hold of yourself.

686
41:44.100 --> 41:46.590
It might not be as bad as you think, sweetheart.

687
41:46.810 --> 41:48.770
I'll call the owner of the place across the road.

688
41:48.790 --> 41:50.920
It's also a veterinary clinic.

689
41:51.290 --> 41:54.390
I heard they're running some errands in Tak.

690
41:54.410 --> 41:56.300
They could probably help, sweetheart.

691
41:58.200 --> 41:59.010
Alright, Mom.

692
42:11.200 --> 42:12.620
Hey, Prasitthichok,

693
42:12.640 --> 42:13.710
is that your mama?

694
42:14.800 --> 42:15.910
- Is she? - Priew!

695
42:15.930 --> 42:17.990
- Whoa, hey, staring at my face... - Hey, I think...

696
42:18.010 --> 42:20.310
- Hey, calm down, Prasitthichok. - That balloon dart vendor is into me!

697
42:20.330 --> 42:22.480
- Calm down. - You know, I only won one plush,

698
42:22.500 --> 42:24.830
but they gave me one, two, three of them!

699
42:25.900 --> 42:27.080
- Hey! - What do you think?

700
42:27.900 --> 42:29.390
Are you taken, girl?

701
42:29.470 --> 42:31.480
- I'm the sexist. - Just go.

702
42:31.580 --> 42:32.430
You're out.

703
42:34.100 --> 42:35.600
Hello, Dad.

704
42:35.610 --> 42:36.770
You look like your dad...

705
42:39.240 --> 42:40.900
Who the hell appeared in your dreams

706
42:41.180 --> 42:42.160
and told you to dress like that?

707
42:42.350 --> 42:43.480
This is Prada.

708
42:44.000 --> 42:45.000
This is also Loewe.

709
42:45.100 --> 42:45.790
Haven't heard of them.

710
42:46.880 --> 42:48.250
Look at how you're dressed.

711
42:48.820 --> 42:50.010
Don't your parents teach you anything?

712
42:50.030 --> 42:50.970
Oh, my gosh.

713
42:51.600 --> 42:52.840
- Brutal. - Oh, my gosh.

714
42:53.080 --> 42:53.800
Priew,

715
42:54.260 --> 42:56.320
what pets...do you have here?

716
42:56.460 --> 42:57.470
- What, Dad? These are... - What pets?

717
42:57.480 --> 42:59.210
My friends. They're my friends.

718
42:59.230 --> 42:59.990
Yeah.

719
43:00.010 --> 43:00.660
Yeah.

720
43:00.880 --> 43:02.210
This one looks like an ancient frog.

721
43:03.780 --> 43:05.310
What the hell is that haircut?

722
43:05.720 --> 43:07.000
I thought you were a damn watercock.

723
43:07.710 --> 43:08.890
Ever seen a watercock?

724
43:09.600 --> 43:11.770
You kids...dress properly.

725
43:11.790 --> 43:12.680
Got it?

726
43:13.510 --> 43:14.200
Dad,

727
43:15.080 --> 43:16.310
how about this?

728
43:18.020 --> 43:19.450
Don't worry at all.

729
43:19.480 --> 43:20.590
As for Priew,

730
43:21.190 --> 43:22.410
I will...

731
43:23.120 --> 43:25.420
take care...of her.

732
43:26.800 --> 43:28.280
Take care of yourself first.

733
43:29.720 --> 43:30.720
Go eat some food,

734
43:30.870 --> 43:32.480
something nutritious, maybe veggies.

735
43:33.300 --> 43:34.440
Then go take a big shit.

736
43:35.050 --> 43:36.400
Go back to your spot.

737
43:36.640 --> 43:38.340
Ugh, why are you giving her a hard time?

738
43:38.360 --> 43:40.300
I don't even know how to cuss you brats out anymore.

739
43:40.940 --> 43:42.600
And why did you mod your motorcycle, huh?!

740
43:43.400 --> 43:44.590
- Sarge. - Is yours discolored?

741
43:44.610 --> 43:45.680
- Yes? - No way.

742
43:49.400 --> 43:51.000
Lieutenant, have you been changing for long?

743
43:51.630 --> 43:53.370
Just now.

744
43:55.420 --> 43:56.420
Why did you change?

745
43:56.620 --> 43:57.520
You looked beautiful.

746
43:58.020 --> 43:59.100
"Beautiful," my butt.

747
43:59.120 --> 44:01.180
That outfit wasn't appropriate for work.

748
44:07.410 --> 44:08.090
Right,

749
44:08.350 --> 44:10.700
there's a stall that sells watermelon juice.

750
44:11.310 --> 44:12.310
It's cold and refreshing.

751
44:12.330 --> 44:13.790
I'll take you there. It's my go-to spot.

752
44:14.100 --> 44:14.670
Wanna come with?

753
44:14.690 --> 44:16.180
- Sure, Sarge. - Come on.

754
44:19.970 --> 44:21.380
Have fun, Daddy.

755
44:21.420 --> 44:23.800
- Can I come with? - Ugh! Where the hell are you going, Stephan?!

756
44:32.420 --> 44:33.080
Lieutenant.

757
44:34.100 --> 44:34.730
Lieutenant.

758
44:36.440 --> 44:37.310
Lieutenant!

759
44:37.490 --> 44:38.600
What, Sarge?

760
44:38.910 --> 44:40.100
You scared me.

761
44:42.460 --> 44:44.110
You were staring without even blinking.

762
44:45.290 --> 44:47.300
What do you mean, "staring"?

763
44:47.520 --> 44:49.100
I didn't even do anything.

764
44:50.490 --> 44:51.610
Tubtim

765
44:52.510 --> 44:53.960
is full to the brim with charm.

766
44:54.410 --> 44:55.330
Right up my alley.

767
44:55.350 --> 44:56.380
Real mommy milkers.

768
44:56.630 --> 44:58.030
What an eyeful.

769
44:58.170 --> 45:00.790
Jeez, goodness me, I'm dead.

770
45:02.320 --> 45:03.910
There is no woman...

771
45:05.000 --> 45:07.200
