775
45:12.900 --> 45:14.090
Careful, or you'll spill it.

776
45:17.290 --> 45:18.610
Here you go,

777
45:18.630 --> 45:19.880
your sweetest,

778
45:19.900 --> 45:21.270
juiciest,

779
45:21.290 --> 45:23.060
most refreshing watermelon smoothies.

780
45:23.470 --> 45:24.290
Aha.

781
45:24.310 --> 45:24.950
Aha.

782
45:25.110 --> 45:26.050
Here you go.

783
45:26.070 --> 45:26.860
Wow.

784
45:26.880 --> 45:28.140
That'd be 100 baht.

785
45:28.240 --> 45:29.540
Watermelons are pricey these days.

786
45:29.560 --> 45:30.710
Wanna help the local farmers?

787
45:30.910 --> 45:31.890
Thank you.

788
45:31.910 --> 45:32.670
Alright.

789
45:33.400 --> 45:34.170
Mm-hm.

790
45:35.510 --> 45:37.090
- Wow... - I'm heading out, Sarge.

791
45:38.540 --> 45:39.050
Eek!

792
45:40.690 --> 45:41.690
Watermelon, please.

793
45:42.100 --> 45:43.100
Okay.

794
45:43.210 --> 45:43.760
One for me, please.

795
45:57.000 --> 45:57.840
How much?

796
46:03.620 --> 46:05.300
However much you wish, my dearest.

797
46:22.320 --> 46:23.320
Smells good...

798
46:24.390 --> 46:25.320
But...

799
46:25.790 --> 46:28.310
not as heavenly as your flower-infused scent.

800
46:31.890 --> 46:33.410
Beautiful,

801
46:35.440 --> 46:38.830
but not as ethereal as you are, Master.

802
46:42.050 --> 46:43.810
You are uttering words like those of a drunk.

803
46:44.230 --> 46:47.320
I suppose Sergeant Piak has taken you to drink liquor.

804
46:49.300 --> 46:51.120
What liquor, Master?

805
46:51.400 --> 46:52.980
I'm on duty.

806
46:53.440 --> 46:55.010
I just took her

807
46:55.030 --> 46:57.200
to get Tubtim's watermelon smoothie.

808
46:59.300 --> 47:00.710
Oh... Oh, wow.

809
47:04.080 --> 47:05.220
We...

810
47:05.240 --> 47:06.700
We stood in line for so long,

811
47:07.510 --> 47:08.890
and you drank it pretty fast.

812
47:08.950 --> 47:10.240
Stop it, Sarge...

813
47:11.950 --> 47:12.520
Master,

814
47:12.810 --> 47:15.510
I took Lieutenant Peem to Tubtim's stall

815
47:15.540 --> 47:16.770
for some watermelon smoothies.

816
47:16.800 --> 47:17.590
Wow...

817
47:17.610 --> 47:18.340
Boom.

818
47:18.360 --> 47:19.200
Kaboom.

819
47:20.380 --> 47:21.360
Real mommy milkers.

820
47:22.700 --> 47:23.260
It's not...

821
47:23.270 --> 47:25.580
It's not what he made it out to be, Master.

822
47:26.300 --> 47:27.310
Don't be shy, Lieutenant.

823
47:28.120 --> 47:29.780
You can get the Great Charm yantra

824
47:30.000 --> 47:31.640
from the Master to go after Tubtim.

825
47:34.400 --> 47:35.830
I didn't...

826
47:36.170 --> 47:37.650
do anything, Master.

827
47:37.670 --> 47:39.840
I was just looking at the yantra

828
47:39.860 --> 47:41.480
you tattooed on her...

829
47:42.020 --> 47:43.960
I just thought it was beautiful.

830
47:44.400 --> 47:45.680
I didn't mean to look

831
47:45.690 --> 47:47.920
at her breasts or anything.

832
47:50.670 --> 47:51.450
Jeez...

833
47:52.080 --> 47:53.180
You don't have to lie, Lieutenant.

834
47:53.560 --> 47:54.990
It's not good to lie in front of her.

835
47:55.700 --> 47:57.290
I saw how pleased you looked.

836
48:00.590 --> 48:02.400
I suppose the lieutenant

837
48:03.060 --> 48:04.980
is parched for watermelon juice

838
48:05.000 --> 48:08.020
from Tubtim's big, sweet watermelons.

839
48:08.140 --> 48:08.810
She is.

840
48:09.240 --> 48:10.190
Absolutely, she is.

841
48:16.810 --> 48:17.680
Paying your respects to the Buddha images?

842
48:17.700 --> 48:18.880
Take my place, for I am weary.

843
48:18.890 --> 48:19.480
What?

844
48:21.820 --> 48:22.540
You!

845
48:22.550 --> 48:23.700
You really enjoy ruining

846
48:23.720 --> 48:25.440
other people's relationships, don't you?

847
48:26.260 --> 48:28.190
- What? - Keep your mouth shut, Sarge.

848
48:29.190 --> 48:30.090
Are you coming in?

849
48:30.110 --> 48:31.400
If not, throw that away for me.

850
48:31.590 --> 48:32.320
What?

851
48:32.480 --> 48:33.800
I was just teasing.

852
48:33.990 --> 48:34.990
Why the mood?

853
48:46.820 --> 48:48.420
All done, Auntie.

854
48:49.010 --> 48:51.210
Sweet Ratha, thank you very much

855
48:51.230 --> 48:53.640
for taking Kord in to donate blood.

856
48:53.660 --> 48:54.900
It's all good.

857
49:20.010 --> 49:21.300
Excuse me.

858
49:22.110 --> 49:23.110
Excuse me.

859
49:25.100 --> 49:26.100
Doctor.

860
49:26.300 --> 49:28.520
The cat is now stable.

861
49:28.710 --> 49:30.240
While you were sleeping,

862
49:30.260 --> 49:32.740
someone brought their cat in to donate blood.

863
49:34.300 --> 49:35.300
Please excuse me.

864
49:35.590 --> 49:36.590
Thank you.

865
49:51.020 --> 49:52.810
Welcome back,

866
49:53.410 --> 49:54.410
little Raek Phob.

867
50:21.200 --> 50:22.540
What happened earlier...

868
50:22.560 --> 50:24.880
Pray, put your hands together and pray.

869
50:24.900 --> 50:26.630
He is incredibly sacred.

870
50:42.800 --> 50:45.180
I prayed that

871
50:45.700 --> 50:47.390
he would protect you

872
50:47.420 --> 50:49.310
from all harm, my dearest.

873
50:53.100 --> 50:55.500
Why would you pray so, my beloved?

874
50:56.300 --> 50:58.420
I am still fine.

875
51:01.960 --> 51:03.410
And have you a clue

876
51:04.130 --> 51:06.400
what awaits you

877
51:07.340 --> 51:09.120
as my karmic soulmate?

878
51:13.240 --> 51:15.400
Lom has told me briefly.

879
51:16.950 --> 51:20.500
But I want to hear from your own mouth

880
51:21.910 --> 51:24.480
what it means to you

881
51:26.460 --> 51:28.610
to have me as your karmic soulmate.

882
51:32.020 --> 51:33.310
"Karmic soulmates"

883
51:34.300 --> 51:37.500
are two souls who have performed good deeds together,

884
51:37.790 --> 51:40.120
fostering one another's merit and virtue.

885
51:41.410 --> 51:43.400
But if they are to share a life together,

886
51:44.310 --> 51:45.900
their souls must be bound by love.

887
51:47.720 --> 51:49.310
To me,

888
51:50.920 --> 51:52.500
you awaken the feelings

889
51:53.200 --> 51:54.870
of desire,

890
51:55.900 --> 51:57.420
yearning,

891
51:57.810 --> 51:59.110
worry,

892
52:01.000 --> 52:02.500
and fear.

893
52:04.810 --> 52:06.910
Fear of losing you.

894
52:12.140 --> 52:14.010
So much so that I myself am unsure

895
52:14.690 --> 52:16.400
whether having a karmic soulmate

896
52:17.090 --> 52:19.600
is as pleasant as my father has declared.

897
52:22.910 --> 52:23.910
Have I...

898
52:24.600 --> 52:27.110
become your weakness?

899
52:30.700 --> 52:32.600
Before we can share a life together,

900
52:33.100 --> 52:35.570
we must overcome many more obstacles,

901
52:38.540 --> 52:40.780
some of which may prove fatal to you.

902
52:45.840 --> 52:47.700
It is well within your right to decide.

903
52:48.750 --> 52:50.080
Should you decide

904
52:50.100 --> 52:51.310
to leave,

905
52:51.850 --> 52:53.110
I shall never halt you.

906
52:54.690 --> 52:56.510
I shall wish for you

907
52:56.790 --> 52:59.330
to find a soul who aids you.

908
53:00.340 --> 53:01.410
I shall wish you happiness.

909
53:05.310 --> 53:06.890
Do you know...

910
53:08.140 --> 53:11.280
what blessing I sought from him?

911
53:16.290 --> 53:18.600
I asked that

912
53:20.600 --> 53:22.500
Master Bulan

913
53:23.810 --> 53:25.770
and I

914
53:26.760 --> 53:30.000
may remain by each other's side forever.

915
53:31.690 --> 53:34.130
Come hell or high water,

916
53:35.000 --> 53:38.210
may we never be separated,

917
53:40.600 --> 53:42.660
for we...

918
53:42.680 --> 53:45.520
are already fated to be karmic soulmates.

919
53:47.800 --> 53:49.800
I love you, Master Bulan.

920
53:51.610 --> 53:52.610
I love you...

921
53:53.920 --> 53:55.500
more than anyone.

922
54:06.660 --> 54:07.660
I...

923
54:08.180 --> 54:10.590
Chanwara Kritpirat,

924
54:13.000 --> 54:15.180
solemnly vow

925
54:16.080 --> 54:17.590
before Lord Buddha

926
54:17.610 --> 54:19.890
and all sacred beings throughout the realm

927
54:20.810 --> 54:23.180
that I shall bind my heart

928
54:23.200 --> 54:24.990
to my dearest alone.

929
54:26.030 --> 54:28.600
Come what hurdles may,

930
54:28.720 --> 54:30.300
we shall fight through them together

931
54:32.220 --> 54:34.400
for as long as I shall breathe.

932
54:38.850 --> 54:40.400
Before all sacred beings

933
54:42.500 --> 54:44.490
throughout the realm,

934
54:44.880 --> 54:46.180
I...

935
54:47.220 --> 54:50.200
Phitcha Ruechakun,

936
54:51.010 --> 54:55.090
solemnly vow before all sacred beings that

937
54:56.310 --> 54:57.710
I...

938
54:58.700 --> 55:01.720
shall remain by Master Bulan's side forever.

939
55:03.880 --> 55:05.480
May no hurdles

940
55:06.710 --> 55:09.110
or perils

941
55:10.220 --> 55:13.400
ever tear her and me apart.

942
55:19.300 --> 55:21.820
All the merits I have accumulated

943
55:22.030 --> 55:23.870
from my past lives

944
55:24.120 --> 55:25.890
to my present life,

945
55:27.090 --> 55:29.770
I dedicate to Master Bulan.

946
55:32.200 --> 55:36.120
May you protect her and keep her safe

947
55:39.720 --> 55:42.100
for as long as I shall breathe.

948
55:51.030 --> 55:52.090
So this...

949
55:53.000 --> 55:54.880
is the first smile

950
55:56.000 --> 55:58.710
that reveals the person I love the most.

951
56:05.090 --> 56:06.820
Don't cry, my beloved.

952
56:13.610 --> 56:15.310
I will be by your side

953
56:16.360 --> 56:17.800
like this forever.

954
56:20.610 --> 56:22.000
I love you, my dearest.

955
56:23.170 --> 56:23.900
Mm.

956
56:41.200 --> 56:43.840
- ♫No need to take the pills, the pills♫ - Oh, Daddy.

957
56:45.630 --> 56:48.440
In your life, have you ever seen spawns of maras?

958
56:49.270 --> 56:50.000
Here they are,

959
56:50.520 --> 56:51.980
in the flesh,

960
56:52.240 --> 56:53.370
right in front of your eyes, ma'am.

961
56:53.510 --> 56:55.210
This one, wow...

962
56:55.710 --> 56:58.210
That hairstyle is called "Gecko's Tail."

963
56:58.330 --> 56:59.370
That one's wearing short shorts.

964
56:59.390 --> 57:00.510
This one shows off her belly button.

965
57:00.530 --> 57:02.410
This one... Wow!

966
57:02.430 --> 57:03.560
Fish-faced, straight from the pond.

967
57:03.690 --> 57:05.510
Look at them spawning to pay respects to Buddha images

968
57:05.530 --> 57:06.490
and make merit.

969
57:06.510 --> 57:07.480
Here they are.

970
57:07.640 --> 57:09.130
Alright, please, ladies and gentlemen,

971
57:09.150 --> 57:10.290
go get changed

972
57:10.310 --> 57:12.760
and behave appropriately for this place.

973
57:12.780 --> 57:13.890
What, Dad?

974
57:14.100 --> 57:15.600
- We just got here, though. - Yeah.

975
57:15.620 --> 57:17.100
- We haven't even paid our respects. - Exactly.

976
57:17.120 --> 57:19.110
We're like, so cute, sexy, and kawaii.

977
57:19.130 --> 57:20.530
- Go away now. - There's that.

978
57:20.550 --> 57:21.420
Be considerate of the images.

979
57:21.450 --> 57:22.410
Alright, we're leaving.

980
57:22.430 --> 57:22.960
Go!

981
57:22.980 --> 57:24.400
- Oh, my... Sadhu. - Alright, alright!

982
57:24.420 --> 57:25.590
- Goodbye. - I'm leaving.

983
57:26.410 --> 57:26.960
There.

984
57:26.970 --> 57:28.880
Kids these days.

985
57:28.900 --> 57:30.720
Ugh! Hurry. I wanna go home and get to bed.

986
57:30.900 --> 57:31.700
- I already told you, babe, - I'm already sleepy.

987
57:31.710 --> 57:32.450
that I want Barbies!

988
57:32.460 --> 57:33.160
Ugh, I'm sleepy.

989
57:33.170 --> 57:34.030
I wanna go home!

990
57:34.050 --> 57:35.420
What about my Barbie?!

991
57:36.000 --> 57:37.000
What the heck?!

992
57:37.240 --> 57:38.110
Damn it!

993
57:38.130 --> 57:39.190
Go home with me.

994
57:39.670 --> 57:40.880
My baby's picking me up.

995
57:41.090 --> 57:42.090
Ugh...

996
57:42.700 --> 57:44.880
Even someone like you is taken.

997
57:45.010 --> 57:45.820
Hop on!

998
57:46.820 --> 57:47.740
Go home now.

999
